  "description": "Kimmie, a synesthete who can hear tastes as music, is an acclaimed young cellist determined to become a renowned conductor. Kale is an unkempt, rude apprentice at a no-name bakery in Paris who says and does whatever he wants. She can’t stand him, but there’s one thing that keeps her coming back: the bread he bakes has the most beautiful music she’s ever heard. Can this unlikely friendship help Kimmie overcome her perfectionism and lead to… something more?\n\n*Source: Tapas*",
